{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the maze! To reach the end of each maze to keep the world's gears of time and space moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities that will make your maze exploration easier, as you total up star gears from each maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo has no ending. Even though the Progression UI indicate there is.<br> The localized languages other than English are just for testing the localization feature, it is not accurate translation and likely will not be added in the full game.<br> <br> <strong>Gameplay </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate to move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.poster.avif?t=1758589420\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.webm?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.mp4?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect star gears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.poster.avif?t=1758589420\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.webm?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.mp4?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the maze with star gears to progressively gain quality of life maze clearing abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/a84918d80ffc7498fbe5b6adca6c9ace.poster.avif?t=1758589420\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/a84918d80ffc7498fbe5b6adca6c9ace.webm?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/a84918d80ffc7498fbe5b6adca6c9ace.mp4?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play higher difficulty if you want to feel challenged! (difficulty is more impactful on levels after level 5)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/b6db8745e9e3a47b7fe1dfe2764f73f7.poster.avif?t=1758589420\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/b6db8745e9e3a47b7fe1dfe2764f73f7.webm?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/b6db8745e9e3a47b7fe1dfe2764f73f7.mp4?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo only have 10 levels to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full game has 50 levels.<br> <br> <br><strong>Story</strong> <br>G.O.T.S(Gear Of Time &amp; Space) has awakened. Not knowing what it really is, but it knows that it wants to keep the world's gears running.     <br> <br>The remaining gears are wearing out, and they do not have any way to repair themselves. Play as G.O.T.S to repair the gear systems that runs the world. <br> <br><strong>Difficulty</strong> <br><strong>Normal -</strong>\u00a0No time limit, take as long as you need to clear the maze.  <br><strong>Hard -</strong>\u00a0Time limit and have to collect all of the star gears the maze contains.  <br><strong>Extreme -</strong> Includes previous difficulty, and an enemy that chases and neutralizes you.  <br>   <br>   <br>  Game was designed for Portrait mobile phones, but I have tested for square and landscape screens as well.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038670?t=1758589420","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4038670?t=1758589420","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/481fa1018e1ce71f9a19cb18ff8ad73ebe4c7bc7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758589420","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/481fa1018e1ce71f9a19cb18ff8ad73ebe4c7bc7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758589420","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate the maze! To reach the end of each maze to keep the world's gears of time and space moving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock abilities that will make your maze exploration easier, as you total up star gears from each maze!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo has no ending. Even though the Progression UI indicate there is.<br> The localized languages other than English are just for testing the localization feature, it is not accurate translation and likely will not be added in the full game.<br> <br> <strong>Gameplay </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rotate to move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.poster.avif?t=1758589420\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.webm?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/d73d558969cce27d8cc966630f51ddc8.mp4?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect star gears!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.poster.avif?t=1758589420\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.webm?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/6df17de1b80bcaa864dbafcc7b048446.mp4?t=1758589420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the maze with star gears to progressively gain quality of life maze clearing abilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/extras/a84918d80ffc7498fbe5b6adca6c9ace.poster.avif?t=1758589420\" width=854 height=480 ><sourc