>   <br>  Game was designed for Portrait mobile phones, but I have tested for square and landscape screens as well.</p>","developers":["LTYGUYDev"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3959830","name":"Rotate Maze: G.O.T.S"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4038670/11a42e81b8fe108d62284e867e0afe0469b40d88/header.jpg?t=1758589420","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4038670/1339998822/588dbbb912843323e5e35e4ea70774d337d3d230/1757990355/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758589419","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4038670/1339998822/588dbbb912843323e5e35e4ea70774d337d3d230/1757990355/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758589419","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4038670/1339998822/588dbbb912843323e5e35e4ea70774d337d3d230/1757990355/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758589419","id":257198428,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198428/movie480.mp4?t=1758589419","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198428/movie_max.mp4?t=1758589419"},"name":"Rotate Maze: G.O.T.S demo trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257198428/50f567bcf3dbe7f794f866511491e30e7bc02709/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758589419","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198428/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1758589419","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257198428/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1758589419"}}],"name":"Rotate 